  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall begin not later than the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "<p>The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and thereafter maintained as such for the lifetime of the development: - drawing numbers SKK4186/104 Rev H, SKK4186/107 Rev D, SKK4186/109 Rev D, SKK4186/110 Rev D, SKK4186/111 Rev B and SKK4186/112 Rev C, dated July 2024.</p>",
    "The materials to be used for the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those specified in drawing numbers SKK4186/104 Rev H and SKK4186/106 Rev D&nbsp; dated July 2024, and shall thereafter be retained as such for the lifetime of the development.",
    "&lt;p&gt;The management of the development hereby approved, including hours of operation and security enforcement, shall be maintained in accordance with the Student Management Plan dated July 2024 and shall thereafter be retained as such for the lifetime of the development.&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;Prior to first occupation of the development hereby permitted the north- and east-facing windows, as illustrated by drawing number SKK4186/104 Rev H dated July 2024, shall be fitted with obscured glazing and apart from any top-hung light that has a sill height of not less than 1.7 metres above the internal finished floor level of the room it serves shall be non-opening. It shall thereafter be retained as such&amp;nbsp;for the lifetime of the development.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
